        <mxCell id="site_note" value="&lt;b&gt;STOREFRONT MERCHANDISING&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Rather than a bloated CMS, site management is controlled directly via category hero banners, collection grouping tags, and boolean flags (is_featured, is_new_arrival) rendered directly in storefront Blade templates." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF9C3;strokeColor=#CA8A04;fontColor=#854D0E;fontSize=11;align=left;spacing=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1">
